    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d642">

                <pb facs="0615" n="1349" xml:id="pg1349"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-11-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 24,
                    1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegrams from Aintab and Marsovan report missionaries safe and protected. Am now
                    able to report that all our 172 missionaries in Turkey are protected. Porte
                    gives assurances tranquillity will soon be restored. I request that ships remain
                    in the Mediterranean, and that commanders keep me advised of their
                    anchorage.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
